{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00313",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.2,
      "end_seconds": 3.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Morning. Just put your bag down anywhere."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.05,
      "end_seconds": 5.8,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Hi. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.6,
      "end_seconds": 8.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Have you been here before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.88,
      "end_seconds": 11.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "A couple of times, but not recently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.99,
      "end_seconds": 14.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Tell me what's been troubling you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.28,
      "end_seconds": 23.28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "It's headaches in the mornings, mostly. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.65,
      "end_seconds": 26.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.15,
      "end_seconds": 35.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, it's been nearly five years now. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.7,
      "end_seconds": 43.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.5,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.02,
      "end_seconds": 57.23,
      "duration_seconds": 13.21,
      "text": "I'd give it a six, out of ten. It happens on and off. I just want to get back to normal, really. I've had a high reading at home too, for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.12,
      "end_seconds": 61.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.63,
      "end_seconds": 65.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "I'd give it a four, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.93,
      "end_seconds": 71.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Have you had headaches in the mornings before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.35,
      "end_seconds": 78.67,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened a couple of years ago, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.07,
      "end_seconds": 82.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.49,
      "end_seconds": 94.67,
      "duration_seconds": 7.18,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, you know, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.07,
      "end_seconds": 99.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Okay, any chest pain, vision changes or weakness at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.05,
      "end_seconds": 105.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "I haven't had chest pain, vision changes or weakness, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.41,
      "end_seconds": 109.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.38,
      "end_seconds": 114.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Okay, so yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.54,
      "end_seconds": 121.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.78,
      "end_seconds": 122.66,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.18,
      "end_seconds": 125.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.5,
      "end_seconds": 142.81,
      "duration_seconds": 16.31,
      "text": "Oh, not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.09,
      "end_seconds": 147.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.59,
      "end_seconds": 156.96,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure. I've never really been one for hospitals. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.52,
      "end_seconds": 161.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.24,
      "end_seconds": 166.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.37,
      "end_seconds": 168.32,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.64,
      "end_seconds": 170.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.39,
      "end_seconds": 177.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.36,
      "end_seconds": 179.33,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Nothing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.75,
      "end_seconds": 184.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.57,
      "end_seconds": 186.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.0,
      "end_seconds": 198.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.77,
      "end_seconds": 202.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Um, I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.4,
      "end_seconds": 208.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.62,
      "end_seconds": 209.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "Yes, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.4,
      "end_seconds": 212.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Hold your arm out like this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.4,
      "end_seconds": 221.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "There's mild pitting swelling at both ankles."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.26,
      "end_seconds": 249.93,
      "duration_seconds": 24.67,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.44,
      "end_seconds": 253.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.07,
      "end_seconds": 273.85,
      "duration_seconds": 19.78,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like hypertension that isn't well controlled. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had headaches in the mornings for nearly five years, and no chest pain or weakness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.95,
      "end_seconds": 277.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.14,
      "end_seconds": 280.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.67,
      "end_seconds": 286.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "I mean, uh, yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.91,
      "end_seconds": 291.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Let's get a lipid profile, for cardiovascular risk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.01,
      "end_seconds": 295.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.75,
      "end_seconds": 303.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an ECG for hypertension. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.66,
      "end_seconds": 305.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.32,
      "end_seconds": 333.4,
      "duration_seconds": 27.08,
      "text": "I'll start you on telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day, long term. That should help with high blood pressure. Check the blood pressure at home, same time each morning, and write down the numbers for me. Salt is the big one, try to keep it low even though it's hard. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.92,
      "end_seconds": 335.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.29,
      "end_seconds": 338.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Let's review you in a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.8,
      "end_seconds": 343.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.78,
      "end_seconds": 350.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.31,
      "text": "Okay, I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.68,
      "end_seconds": 358.96,
      "duration_seconds": 8.28,
      "text": "So, I take the telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day and come back in a month. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.83,
      "end_seconds": 366.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Alright, that's everything from me. Any other questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.59,
      "end_seconds": 372.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "I, I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    }
  ]
}